      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just did some science, to check. This is definitely a regression, and never happened in release or even avatars-3.0.\nopen-beta (950): Happened 4/4 times, tested both VR and desktop.\navatars-3.0 (94301): Happened 0/4 times, tested both VR and desktop.\nrelease: Happened 0/4 times, tested both VR and desktop.\nSeems extremely reproducible, to me in the open-beta version.",
