  "details": "Reproducible when this World ID is set as home world: [wrld_10c4582e-69ea-4470-a969-149279656969](https://www.vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_10c4582e-69ea-4470-a969-149279656969)\nBoth Desktop and VR, high end PC.\nThe client shows the following error in the log before leaving the invite-only home and switching to public:\n```\nError      -  [RoomManager] Cannot join room. Connection not ready for join operations\n```\nFull output log: https://gist.github.com/lyuma/af5466148ced3ae5bfde997cbf453a80\nIn case it is relevant, I use only `--profile=1` in launch options.",
